000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    SINQFRT.
000400 AUTHOR.        LM BUNN / BARBARA WINTER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.  MAY 27, 1983.
000600*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

001200*************************************************************
000800*REMARKS.       SUB-PROGRAM OF THE RECEIVER INQUIRY PROGRAM.
000900*
001000*         THIS IS A SUB-ROUTINE WHICH SHOWS FREIGHT INFORMATION
001100*                FOR A PARTICULAR RECEIVING SLIP.
001200*************************************************************

001300*************************************************************
001400*                      T I N Q F R T                        *
001500*                                                           *
001600*         THIS IS A SUBROUTINE THAT SHOWS FREIGHT           *
001700*         INFORMATION FOR RECEIVING SLIPS.                  *
001800*                                                           *
001900*   THIS PROGRAM CAN BE CALLED DIRECTLY FROM THE MAIN       *
002000*   PROGRAM REQUESTING A PO NUMBER, OR FROM THE RECEIVER    *
002100*   ITEM INQUIRY SCREEN.                                    *
002200*      1.  IF CALLED FROM THE MAIN PROGRAM, THE STARTING    *
002300*          RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER IS PASSED AND THE USER     *
002400*          MAY BROWSE FREIGHT DATA FORWARD AND BACKWARD.    *
002500*          THEY MAY CHOOSE TO GO TO THE RECEIVER SCREEN     *
002600*          AND THAT INQUIRY WILL BEGIN ON THE RECEIVER      *
002700*          WHERE THE FREIGHT INQUIRY LEFT OFF.  EVEN        *
002800*          THOUGH THEY MAY THEN BROWSE RECEIVING ITEMS,     *
002900*          THE FREIGHT INQUIRY WILL PICK UP FROM WHERE      *
003000*          IT PREVIOUSLY HAD LEFT OFF.                      *
003100*                                                           *
003200*      2.  IF CALLED FROM THE RECEIVER ITEM INQUIRY, THIS   *
003300*          PROGRAM BEGINS DISPLAY FREIGHT DATA FROM WHERE   *
003400*          WHERE THE RECEIVER INQUIRY LEFT OFF.             *
003500*************************************************************
003600*************************************************************
003700*     CALLING PROGRAMS:                                     *
003800*      1.  SINQRSA  -  ALL RECEIVERS SCREEN                 *
003900*      2.  SINQFRT  -  FREIGHT INQUIRY                      *
004000*                                                           *
004100*     CALLED PROGRAMS:                                      *
004200*      1.  SINQRSI  -  RECEIVER ITEM INQUIRY                *
004300*      2.  TSCRPRNT -  PRINTS SCREEN CONTENTS               *
004400*      3.  TBLOWUP  -  ABORTS PROGRAM CLEANLY               *
004500*************************************************************
004600*************************************************************
004700*************************************************************
004800*                   PROGRAM CHANGES                         *
      *C08/16/93 - JSB                                            *
      *C    FOR A FREIGHT REFERBACK ON AN INVOICELESS PO, DISPLAY *
      *C    THE PACKING SLIP NUMBER THAT WAS ENTERED FOR THE      *
      *C    RECEIVING SLIP AND NOT THE REFERBACKED PACKING SLIP.  *
      *C
      *C 11/22/93  JEFF BUNGO  REQUEST #4502
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO GO TO HISTORY DATABASE FOR THE
      *C    INQUIRY IF PASS-HISTORY-FLAG IS SET TO "Y".
      *C
      *C 02/21/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQUEST #6449
      *C    ADDED FIELDS TO HISTORY DATABASES TO MATCH LIVE
      *C    DATABASES.  CHANGED PROGRAM TO DISPLAY THESE FIELDS
      *C    ON AN INQUIRY.
      *C
      *C 06/07/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C    EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C    RECOMPILE TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      *C    FOR PASSED BINARY DATE TO TDATECHK FOR DISPLAY FORMAT,
      *C    SUBTRACT 19M OR 20M BEFORE THE CALL.
      *C
      *C 04/03/97  JEFF BUNGO
      *C    FOR HISTORY DISPLAY, MOVE RCVR SEQUENCE SAVED IN
      *C    DPOFREIGHT TO THE SCREEN.  KELLY NEEDS THIS TO
      *C    CORRELATE TO PRAPS RECEIVER NUMBER.
      *C
      *C 03/18/04  CA YODER
      *C    PROGRAM NAME WAS NOT DISPLAYING IN BLOWUP MESSAGE.
      *C    CORRECTED PROBLEM.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
DCR01 *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
DCR01 *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSINQFRT CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
DCR01 *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
DCR01 *****************************************************************

